---
import core from '../../../lib/relational-collection/core.json';
const lines=core.order_items.filter(x=>x.order_id===103);
---
<figure class="join-work" data-join-work data-products={JSON.stringify(core.products)} data-lines={JSON.stringify(lines)} aria-labelledby="r11-join-title">
 <figcaption id="r11-join-title"><span>Figure 2</span> The same matches, different repeated work</figcaption>
 <label>Match the two lines with products <select data-method><option value="scan">Nested loop · table scan</option><option value="index">Nested loop · indexed lookup</option><option value="hash">Hash join</option></select></label>
 <div class="join-layout"><div><p class="panel-label">Order 103’s lines</p>{lines.map(x=><div class="row" data-line={x.line_no}><strong>Line {x.line_no}</strong><span>{x.product_id} × {x.quantity}</span></div>)}</div><div><p class="panel-label">Products</p>{core.products.map(x=><div class="row" data-product={x.product_id}><strong>{x.product_id}</strong><span>{x.name}</span><small data-hash={x.product_id}></small></div>)}</div></div>
 <div class="results"><p class="panel-label">Matched receipt lines</p><p data-result data-live>None yet.</p></div><p data-count data-live></p>
 <p data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 2 controls"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step></span><div data-hold><span></span></div></div>
 <details><summary>Read the three routes as text</summary><p>Scanning nested loop: line 1 checks P3, P7 and P9; line 2 checks P3, P7 and P9 again. Six product-row comparisons find two matches. Indexed nested loop: each line looks up its product ID, making two index searches, whose internal page work is omitted. Hash join: read all three products into a hash table, then probe it once for P7 and once for P3. All routes return line 1 with Blue mug and line 2 with Green tea, 50 g.</p></details>
 <p class="caption">Conceptual algorithms over the fixed core rows. The scan deliberately checks all products per line. The counters count different operations: row comparisons, index searches, or build rows and probes. They are not comparable elapsed times, captured native plans or hash-collision measurements.</p>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-join-work]').forEach(root=>{
 const products=JSON.parse(root.dataset.products!),lines=JSON.parse(root.dataset.lines!);const select=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-method]')!;
 const actions=()=>select.value==='scan'?lines.flatMap(l=>products.map(p=>({kind:'compare',l,p}))):select.value==='index'?lines.map(l=>({kind:'lookup',l,p:products.find(p=>p.product_id===l.product_id)})):[...products.map(p=>({kind:'build',p})),...lines.map(l=>({kind:'probe',l,p:products.find(p=>p.product_id===l.product_id)}))];
 const draw=(s:number)=>{const list=actions(),done=list.slice(0,s),a=list[s-1];const hits=done.filter(x=>x.l&&x.l.product_id===x.p.product_id);const built=done.filter(x=>x.kind==='build').map(x=>x.p.product_id);
 root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-line]').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('active',a?.l?.line_no===Number(el.dataset.line)));
 root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-product]').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('active',a?.p?.product_id===el.dataset.product));
 root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-hash]').forEach(el=>el.textContent=built.includes(el.dataset.hash)?'in hash table':'');
 root.querySelector('[data-result]')!.textContent=hits.map(x=>`Line ${x.l.line_no}: ${x.p.name}`).join(' · ')||'None yet.';
 root.querySelector('[data-count]')!.textContent=select.value==='scan'?`${s} product-row comparisons` : select.value==='index'?`${s} index searches; internal tree work omitted`:`${built.length} build rows; ${done.filter(x=>x.kind==='probe').length} probes`;
 root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=!a?'Start with two qualifying order lines. Each needs its matching product name.':a.kind==='build'?`Read ${a.p.product_id} into a hash table keyed by product ID.`:a.kind==='compare'?`Line ${a.l.line_no} asks for ${a.l.product_id}. Compare ${a.p.product_id}: ${a.l.product_id===a.p.product_id?'match — emit the receipt line.':'no match.'}`:a.kind==='lookup'?`Use the product index to search for ${a.l.product_id}. Return its name for line ${a.l.line_no}.`:`Probe the hash table for ${a.l.product_id}. Its stored product supplies line ${a.l.line_no}’s name.`;
 };
 const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>actions().length+1,draw});select.addEventListener('change',()=>{player.render();root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.click();});
 });
</script>
<style>.join-work{padding:1rem;margin:2rem 0;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);background:var(--color-surface-alt);font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.2rem var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:1rem}figcaption span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.7rem}.join-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:1rem}.panel-label{font-weight:600}.row{padding:.65rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);margin:.5rem 0;display:grid;background:var(--color-surface)}.row small{color:var(--color-accent);min-height:1.5em}.active{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:-2px}.results{border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong)}select{display:block;max-width:100%;font:inherit;padding:.5rem;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}button{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);border-radius:.25rem;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);padding:.45rem .65rem;cursor:pointer}button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.5}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}[data-explanation]{border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding-left:.8rem;min-height:4.5em}[data-hold]{width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--color-rule)}[data-hold] span{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:var(--color-accent)}.caption{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}details{margin-top:1rem}summary{cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:520px){.join-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}select{font-size:.8rem}}</style>
